# TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day16

| Word        | Meaning    | Example                                                      |
| ----------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| establish   | 설립하다, 확립하다 | The university established a new research center.            |
| demonstrate | 보여주다, 입증하다 | The experiment demonstrated the effectiveness of the method. |
| assess      | 평가하다       | Researchers assessed the environmental impact.               |

---

## Synonyms

### establish

→ create / found

### demonstrate

→ show / prove

### assess

→ evaluate / judge

